WEBVTT

00:00:02.958 --> 00:00:05.083
Good morning, sleepyhead.

00:00:06.875 --> 00:00:10.125
Kinan and the others
are waiting for you to eat breakfast.

00:00:11.708 --> 00:00:12.666
What's the matter?

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:15.166
Amanda is…

00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:29.375
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:01:50.332 --> 00:01:51.375
(Episode 12
Fran Is Looking Forward to a New Adventure)
The bird…

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.189
(Episode 12
Fran Is Looking Forward to a New Adventure)
It's glowing!

00:01:53.189 --> 00:01:53.917
(Episode 12
Fran Is Looking Forward to a New Adventure)

00:01:53.917 --> 00:01:55.375
A monster?

00:01:56.625 --> 00:01:59.207
All these damn spiders!

00:01:59.207 --> 00:02:01.125
What's with these creatures?

00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:03.875
Sorry, Cruise.

00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:08.375
We got into this adversity
all because I didn't disarm the traps.

00:02:08.375 --> 00:02:11.000
At least we still have our weapons.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.125
Either way, save the reflections for later.

00:02:18.375 --> 00:02:20.582
First, we've got to make it out of here alive.

00:02:20.582 --> 00:02:22.375
Make it out of here alive?

00:02:22.917 --> 00:02:25.500
Gennel is poisoned.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.167
Sorry, Krad…

00:02:28.167 --> 00:02:31.082
The other party is all tied up too!

00:02:31.082 --> 00:02:34.625
We're doomed!
They're going to lay their eggs in me!

00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:36.292
Don't say such gross things!

00:02:36.292 --> 00:02:39.082
Someone save us!

00:02:39.082 --> 00:02:41.042
This is embarrassing…

00:02:41.042 --> 00:02:42.417
Sword Technique…

00:02:43.332 --> 00:02:45.000
Dawn Break!

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:48.792
Nice!

00:02:48.792 --> 00:02:49.957
Ouch!

00:02:49.957 --> 00:02:50.957
Cruise,

00:02:50.957 --> 00:02:53.792
we're out of antidotes and potions.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.332
This is bad.

00:02:56.332 --> 00:02:58.500
If only there was a breakthrough…

00:03:01.457 --> 00:03:02.542
A trap?

00:03:02.542 --> 00:03:05.207
It's activated without being triggered.

00:03:05.957 --> 00:03:07.707
Hey, look at that thing!

00:03:07.707 --> 00:03:08.957
Wait…

00:03:08.957 --> 00:03:10.750
This is bad!

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:13.832
We're going to die!

00:03:20.957 --> 00:03:22.000
What…

00:03:22.957 --> 00:03:24.875
I've come to rescue you all.

00:03:24.875 --> 00:03:26.667
Looks like we made it.

00:03:26.667 --> 00:03:28.792
Bart! Victor!

00:03:28.792 --> 00:03:30.125
Miss Amanda!

00:03:30.125 --> 00:03:31.582
You guys are all right!

00:03:31.582 --> 00:03:33.167
- Krad!
- I was worried about you guys.

00:03:33.167 --> 00:03:34.667
Here, the antidote.

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:35.832
Thanks…

00:03:35.832 --> 00:03:37.582
They're going to eat us!

00:03:37.582 --> 00:03:39.000
Up here!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.582
Help us!

00:03:40.582 --> 00:03:42.457
Take care of them, Urushi.

00:03:48.292 --> 00:03:49.125
We're saved…

00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:51.000
Ow…

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.707
Can I use fire?

00:03:52.707 --> 00:03:54.625
Of course.

00:03:54.625 --> 00:03:55.832
Fire Magic.

00:03:55.832 --> 00:03:58.082
Burst Flame!

00:03:58.082 --> 00:04:00.125
Tri-Explosion!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:04.542
What magnificent fire magic.

00:04:04.542 --> 00:04:06.500
Gale Hazard!

00:04:07.917 --> 00:04:09.250
They're strong, all right.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.625
It's not over for us yet, either.

00:04:11.625 --> 00:04:12.832
Right.

00:04:12.832 --> 00:04:14.625
Dragon

00:04:14.625 --> 00:04:16.791
Roar!

00:04:16.791 --> 00:04:18.583
Good to see you in one piece.

00:04:18.583 --> 00:04:20.625
Tarua.

00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:23.666
It was a good idea
to send you to find help, after all.

00:04:23.666 --> 00:04:25.000
That little girl

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:31.541
actually called me,
a guardian spirit, a "monster".

00:04:31.541 --> 00:04:34.250
Well, please don't take it to heart.

00:04:35.166 --> 00:04:36.750
We came to provide assistance.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.541
Now, stop lazing about and fight.

00:04:39.541 --> 00:04:41.458
Teacher, over there!

00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:46.583
So that's where it was!

00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:48.375
I want payback.

00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:51.083
We're going to make it pay for what it did to you

00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:53.708
and gobble up its rare crystal!

00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:04.208
It wrapped itself in webs!

00:05:04.208 --> 00:05:05.791
Is it going to get away again?

00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:08.666
Go, my guardian spirit, Tarua!

00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:10.291
Inspire everyone!

00:05:10.291 --> 00:05:11.666
Understood.

00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:15.208
I'll confuse the spiders too!

00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:18.208
I've been waiting for this!

00:05:18.208 --> 00:05:19.500
It feels warm.

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.125
We've been revived!

00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:24.416
We'll surely win now.

00:05:24.416 --> 00:05:26.833
We'll take care of the spiderlings!

00:05:26.833 --> 00:05:29.958
You just concentrate
on the Trickster Spider, Miss Fran.

00:05:29.958 --> 00:05:30.916
Okay.

00:05:30.916 --> 00:05:32.583
All right. Let's do this.

00:05:32.583 --> 00:05:34.500
Flare Blast!

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:41.875
That girl…

00:05:42.666 --> 00:05:44.208
We're going to take it down in one go!

00:05:45.041 --> 00:05:47.416
Elemental Sword, Fire!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.625
It's like a fort of spiders this time.

00:05:58.625 --> 00:06:00.000
Teacher!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.166
Damn it! It's getting away!

00:06:02.166 --> 00:06:04.791
No other choice…
We'll have to combine our powers.

00:06:04.791 --> 00:06:06.625
We're going to take them out with all we've got!

00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:09.541
Thunder Magic!

00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:11.208
Stun Bolt!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.125
Thunder magic is incredible!

00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:22.708
Stun Bolt.

00:06:22.708 --> 00:06:26.208
The attack does not deal much damage
but is able to paralyze targets.

00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:27.833
I see.

00:06:27.833 --> 00:06:29.000
If we paralyze an opponent first

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.041
and damage it with a fire magic attack,

00:06:31.041 --> 00:06:33.125
we should be able
to extend the range of our attacks.

00:06:33.125 --> 00:06:35.166
Let's practice when we get back, Fran!

00:06:35.166 --> 00:06:37.625
Going buzz buzz is great!

00:06:37.625 --> 00:06:39.041
No way…

00:06:39.041 --> 00:06:40.791
She can already use thunder magic!

00:06:41.708 --> 00:06:43.541
Fran has become even stronger!

00:06:50.333 --> 00:06:51.791
Fran!

00:06:55.791 --> 00:07:02.666
I didn't teach Flamia and Kinan,
who wanted to be adventurers, how to fight.

00:07:03.708 --> 00:07:06.583
I believed that wasn't
a path they should go down,

00:07:06.583 --> 00:07:09.375
and it would shorten their lives…

00:07:10.625 --> 00:07:13.666
I did it because I wanted them to live…

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.041
But…

00:07:15.041 --> 00:07:17.333
my way of protecting them
only ended up backfiring…

00:07:18.125 --> 00:07:21.583
Go for the kill and take its crystal!

00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:25.583
There is no way I would let you die too.

00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:32.083
Storm Magic,

00:07:32.083 --> 00:07:34.416
Wind Volteccer!

00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:41.000
I will protect Fran!

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.041
Unbelievable…

00:07:46.041 --> 00:07:47.583
Miss Amanda…

00:07:47.583 --> 00:07:49.791
That's A-rank for you…

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.833
Huh? Where's the spider?

00:07:53.833 --> 00:07:57.875
The Trickster Spider has been destroyed
along with its crystal.

00:07:57.875 --> 00:07:59.416
Destroyed…

00:07:59.416 --> 00:08:03.000
Are you all right, Fran?

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.500
Um… It would've been great
if you left the crystal

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:07.958
in fact, just saying…

00:08:07.958 --> 00:08:10.625
I wanted to get revenge myself…

00:08:12.208 --> 00:08:16.708
Did… Did I mess things up?

00:08:16.708 --> 00:08:19.666
This hole seems to be a passage.

00:08:19.666 --> 00:08:22.333
The core room must be on the other end of it.

00:08:22.333 --> 00:08:25.083
All right.
Let us advance to our final destination.

00:08:25.083 --> 00:08:26.583
- Yes!
- All right!

00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:31.708
Don't hate me, Fran…

00:08:31.708 --> 00:08:33.707
I don't hate you.

00:08:33.707 --> 00:08:36.457
- Mama will cry if you hate me…
- But that storm magic…

00:08:36.457 --> 00:08:37.332
You're not my mama.

00:08:37.332 --> 00:08:41.875
It's even more powerful
than the Greater Demon's advanced magic.

00:08:41.875 --> 00:08:44.957
As expected… A-ranks are something else indeed…

00:08:44.957 --> 00:08:46.957
Wow!

00:08:46.957 --> 00:08:48.957
It's a treasure trove!

00:08:48.957 --> 00:08:51.000
I didn't expect there
to be so many crystals here!

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:53.167
Are we supposed to collect all of these?

00:08:53.167 --> 00:08:55.082
How dazzling!

00:08:55.082 --> 00:08:56.000
Everyone,

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.457
please put them into the bags we distributed.

00:08:58.457 --> 00:08:59.417
And remember,

00:08:59.417 --> 00:09:03.207
this matter must be kept strictly confidential.

00:09:03.207 --> 00:09:07.582
The guild and the country will take action
regarding any leakage of information.

00:09:07.582 --> 00:09:09.375
- Yes.
- Roger.

00:09:09.375 --> 00:09:12.375
Keep your lips sealed,
and don't try to sneak any into your clothes.

00:09:12.375 --> 00:09:14.082
As if I would!

00:09:15.207 --> 00:09:19.792
The dungeon settings didn't change
so that only Trap Spiders are supposed to spawn,

00:09:19.792 --> 00:09:21.750
Cruise.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.167
What caused all of this, then?

00:09:23.875 --> 00:09:26.957
Should we clear the dungeon of all evolved forms?

00:09:26.957 --> 00:09:29.917
It's not good to have
the mana source reduced too much, either.

00:09:29.917 --> 00:09:32.542
Let's leave it to the guild master to decide.

00:09:32.542 --> 00:09:33.875
All right.

00:09:34.875 --> 00:09:36.000
What?

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.250
Um… Well…

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.292
I… Um…

00:09:40.292 --> 00:09:44.582
Thank you for saving my party members…

00:09:44.582 --> 00:09:48.167
Someone who can ride such a huge wolf

00:09:48.167 --> 00:09:49.957
is no opponent of mine…

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:53.417
There was a spider behind you.

00:09:53.417 --> 00:09:57.167
If I hadn't done that, you would be dead now.

00:09:57.167 --> 00:09:59.250
I can't stand you, after all!

00:10:03.292 --> 00:10:05.500
Black Cats that evolved?

00:10:06.207 --> 00:10:07.832
Do you know any?

00:10:07.832 --> 00:10:11.292
So that is your aim as well…

00:10:11.292 --> 00:10:12.917
As well?

00:10:14.542 --> 00:10:19.167
A few Black Kittens I knew
said the same thing once.

00:10:19.167 --> 00:10:21.875
Did they manage to evolve?

00:10:23.917 --> 00:10:26.957
They've gone to the other world now…

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.125
Oh…

00:10:30.125 --> 00:10:33.707
Fran, I support you…

00:10:35.332 --> 00:10:37.707
But you must never push yourself too far.

00:10:41.457 --> 00:10:45.917
Amanda genuinely cares about Fran…

00:10:49.792 --> 00:10:50.917
In any case,

00:10:50.917 --> 00:10:56.582
that's a wrap
for Fran's first party dungeon quest.

00:10:57.917 --> 00:10:59.500
(Reincarnated as a Sword)

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:03.332
You're certainly an attention magnet.

00:11:04.049 --> 00:11:07.082
(Urushi, Downsized Form)
This time you've got yourself a C-rank familiar.

00:11:07.082 --> 00:11:07.940
(Urushi, Downsized Form)

00:11:08.292 --> 00:11:11.832
Nevertheless, you completed the request.

00:11:11.832 --> 00:11:14.292
Good work.

00:11:14.292 --> 00:11:16.082
But I also failed.

00:11:16.082 --> 00:11:18.417
I didn't manage to do much.

00:11:18.417 --> 00:11:21.457
But you had a mock battle with Amanda,

00:11:21.457 --> 00:11:23.375
returned safely from the teleportation trap,

00:11:23.375 --> 00:11:25.082
summoned a familiar,

00:11:25.082 --> 00:11:27.292
and saved your companions…

00:11:27.292 --> 00:11:29.500
That is more than enough
to prove your capabilities.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.792
After this mission, the guild master
should be cleared of favoritism.

00:11:33.792 --> 00:11:38.250
All right. I will issue you the permit
to access Ulmutt's dungeon.

00:11:39.042 --> 00:11:40.792
Thank you, Guild Master.

00:11:41.582 --> 00:11:46.000
Also, do check your class before you leave.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.375
Okay.

00:11:47.375 --> 00:11:50.582
When do you plan on leaving Alessa?

00:11:50.582 --> 00:11:53.582
Tomorrow or the day after.

00:11:53.582 --> 00:11:57.125
I see. It's going to get
a little lonely without you here.

00:11:58.082 --> 00:12:00.082
You're relieved, aren't you?

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.332
Oh, you noticed?

00:12:03.332 --> 00:12:06.667
But I was sincere when I said
I would feel lonely.

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:12.832
Thank you for everything, Guild Master.

00:12:12.832 --> 00:12:14.042
Mm.

00:12:16.832 --> 00:12:18.457
Amazing, Fran!

00:12:18.457 --> 00:12:21.250
You can already qualify for a class change!

00:12:22.207 --> 00:12:24.667
Now, please place your hand on the crystal.

00:12:26.167 --> 00:12:27.542
User, Fran,

00:12:27.542 --> 00:12:31.582
your class has been changed to Sword Magus.

00:12:31.582 --> 00:12:34.375
Fran is now a Sword Magus!

00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:35.792
Congratulations!

00:12:37.375 --> 00:12:39.000
We're here!

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.375
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:41.375 --> 00:12:43.082
Is everything ready?

00:12:43.082 --> 00:12:45.125
It's my greatest masterpiece.

00:12:45.125 --> 00:12:46.957
Go ahead and put it on.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.250
(Black Cat Boots, Black Cat Cape)

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:51.875
(Black Cat Gloves)
Fran looks wonderful no matter what she wears.

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:54.457
(Black Cat Armor)
I call this the Black Cat Series.

00:12:54.457 --> 00:12:58.750
(Black Cat Belt, Black Cat Divine Earring)
Rejoice. It's a full set of named items.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.375
Named items?

00:13:00.375 --> 00:13:04.000
Amanda mentioned this when I named Urushi too.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:08.707
Named items have improved stats
and blessings from the gods.

00:13:08.707 --> 00:13:11.750
You must thank the God of Beasts and Insects.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.707
Thank you very much.

00:13:13.707 --> 00:13:16.250
Just one thing, Garrus…

00:13:17.042 --> 00:13:18.082
Her belly button!

00:13:18.082 --> 00:13:19.917
Her belly button is being exposed!

00:13:19.917 --> 00:13:22.792
What is the meaning of this?

00:13:22.792 --> 00:13:28.542
Lots of beastkin, especially cats,
prefer lighter equipment.

00:13:28.542 --> 00:13:31.125
Some prefer feeling the wind against their skin,

00:13:31.125 --> 00:13:34.457
and others dislike heavy equipment
that restrains their movements.

00:13:34.457 --> 00:13:36.792
Is that so?

00:13:36.792 --> 00:13:40.000
This feels much more comfortable
and easier to move than the dress armor!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:42.125
But if your belly takes damage…

00:13:42.125 --> 00:13:45.707
That's where the "protection" comes into effect.

00:13:45.707 --> 00:13:47.875
Take this!

00:13:49.125 --> 00:13:52.417
Just like that, it can repel some attacks.

00:13:52.417 --> 00:13:54.917
It's true. That didn't hurt at all!

00:13:55.792 --> 00:14:00.125
Besides, if the attack
is strong enough to penetrate this protection,

00:14:00.125 --> 00:14:03.500
then it'll surely damage high-ranked
heavy armor as well.

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:04.750
I see.

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:09.042
So it's better for Fran
to be agile and nimble instead.

00:14:09.042 --> 00:14:12.875
This Black Cat Armor will not only
provide her protection and boost her stats,

00:14:12.875 --> 00:14:15.082
but it also blocks instant deaths.

00:14:15.082 --> 00:14:18.707
It's an effect that only applies to Black Cats.

00:14:18.707 --> 00:14:21.832
Being able to block instant deaths is a big deal.

00:14:21.832 --> 00:14:24.750
It's the perfect set
of specialized equipment for Fran!

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:26.875
Fran's specialized equipment!

00:14:26.875 --> 00:14:29.292
This is great, Fran.

00:14:29.292 --> 00:14:31.042
Thank you, Garrus.

00:14:31.042 --> 00:14:35.250
Not at all. I haven't had this much fun
working on a piece for a long time.

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:39.000
So, you guys are headed to Ulmutt next?

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:44.332
Actually, I was thinking of moving to Ulmutt too.

00:14:44.332 --> 00:14:45.542
Really?

00:14:45.542 --> 00:14:47.875
Why don't you come with us, Garrus?

00:14:47.875 --> 00:14:50.125
But you'll be taking the sea route, right?

00:14:50.125 --> 00:14:53.417
Yes. I wanted to show Fran the sea.

00:14:53.417 --> 00:14:58.917
Dwarves are mountain dwellers.
We can't swim, so I'll be taking the land route.

00:14:58.917 --> 00:15:01.457
Come and find me once you get there.

00:15:01.457 --> 00:15:02.707
Got it.

00:15:02.707 --> 00:15:04.542
See you in Ulmutt, then.

00:15:04.542 --> 00:15:05.582
All right.

00:15:09.125 --> 00:15:11.417
Have you been well, Rufus?

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:15.125
Oh, Amanda. Haven't seen you in a while.

00:15:15.125 --> 00:15:16.500
What's up?

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.500
Just dropping by to check on my graduate.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.792
How's business? Better nowadays?

00:15:21.792 --> 00:15:23.207
That's rude.

00:15:23.207 --> 00:15:27.375
A Black Cat girl carrying a sword came by

00:15:27.375 --> 00:15:31.207
and bought a bunch of spices and cutlery.

00:15:31.207 --> 00:15:33.167
That's Fran.

00:15:33.167 --> 00:15:34.625
You know her?

00:15:34.625 --> 00:15:37.917
As expected of the Guardian of Children, Amanda.

00:15:39.875 --> 00:15:41.332
Whenever I see her,

00:15:41.332 --> 00:15:44.917
I'm reminded of those two troublemakers.

00:15:44.917 --> 00:15:46.917
Indeed.

00:15:46.917 --> 00:15:49.292
After leaving the orphanage,

00:15:49.292 --> 00:15:52.250
they only came back once to deliver some news

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.250
before leaving for another journey again.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.207
I only found out about their passing

00:15:57.207 --> 00:15:59.730
quite a while after.

00:16:00.832 --> 00:16:04.582
I left and tried my best to track them,

00:16:04.582 --> 00:16:07.167
but I couldn't even find anything
that belonged to them.

00:16:07.167 --> 00:16:09.625
I cursed myself for my uselessness

00:16:09.625 --> 00:16:12.625
and was filled with regret.

00:16:13.792 --> 00:16:17.167
If only I had taught them how to fight properly.

00:16:17.167 --> 00:16:21.375
If only I had sent them off proudly with a smile…

00:16:25.082 --> 00:16:27.207
See you. I'll come again.

00:16:27.207 --> 00:16:28.207
Sure.

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:35.500
Amanda is…

00:16:55.625 --> 00:16:59.417
I'll be waiting for you
behind the reception, Fran.

00:16:59.417 --> 00:17:01.542
Make sure you visit me whenever you come back!

00:17:01.542 --> 00:17:03.082
You have to!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.041
Take care, Nell.

00:17:06.041 --> 00:17:10.083
Embarking on an adventure is a dangerous task.

00:17:10.083 --> 00:17:15.000
Whenever you are in trouble, remember to
recite the adventurers' 100 golden rules!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:15.666
Impossible.

00:17:15.666 --> 00:17:16.791
What?

00:17:17.333 --> 00:17:18.291
Fran…

00:17:18.291 --> 00:17:20.541
I'm going to miss you, Fran…

00:17:20.541 --> 00:17:24.041
Stop by my shop if you come back to Alessa.

00:17:24.041 --> 00:17:26.291
Take care of yourself, Fran.

00:17:26.291 --> 00:17:28.000
We'll train harder,

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.916
so we don't lose to you.

00:17:29.916 --> 00:17:33.291
Be wary of traps along your way.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.291
Thank you, everyone.

00:17:36.291 --> 00:17:37.416
Hey!

00:17:38.583 --> 00:17:40.875
Safe travels!

00:17:40.875 --> 00:17:42.875
I'll win next time!

00:17:42.875 --> 00:17:44.625
Not a chance.

00:17:44.625 --> 00:17:46.625
What did you just say?

00:17:46.625 --> 00:17:50.250
Fran has made lots of friends…

00:17:51.291 --> 00:17:52.958
This makes me glad.

00:17:52.958 --> 00:17:54.458
Amanda,

00:17:55.583 --> 00:17:58.458
when I come back, I'll be stronger than ever.

00:17:58.458 --> 00:18:00.791
I won't lose the next time we fight.

00:18:03.291 --> 00:18:04.750
What's the matter?

00:18:05.958 --> 00:18:09.375
I'll be looking forward to a stronger Fran.

00:18:10.625 --> 00:18:13.083
Teacher, I'll leave Fran in your care.

00:18:13.083 --> 00:18:14.916
No problem.

00:18:15.791 --> 00:18:18.791
Fran isn't alone, after all.

00:18:18.791 --> 00:18:21.333
I'll always have Teacher with me.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:24.125
That makes me a little jealous,

00:18:24.125 --> 00:18:27.500
but… I'm really glad.

00:18:30.083 --> 00:18:32.291
Then, I'm going.

00:18:34.166 --> 00:18:40.041
Nothing… You never did give in
and call Amanda "Mama"…

00:18:40.041 --> 00:18:42.708
My mother and Amanda are different.

00:18:42.708 --> 00:18:43.958
That's true.

00:18:44.916 --> 00:18:47.458
But just once…

00:18:49.541 --> 00:18:52.541
Bye, Mamanda!

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.583
What is it?

00:18:58.583 --> 00:19:02.166
Amanda is everyone's Mamanda.

00:19:03.750 --> 00:19:06.625
We have news to share, Amanda.

00:19:06.625 --> 00:19:11.541
We've decided to combine our names…

00:19:11.541 --> 00:19:14.083
and name this child, Fran.

00:19:14.083 --> 00:19:15.583
Will you give us your blessings?

00:19:16.583 --> 00:19:20.750
- Safe travels…
- Take care! Goodbye…

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:23.458
Kinan, Flamia…

00:19:23.458 --> 00:19:26.958
The precious child you left behind, Fran, …

00:19:26.958 --> 00:19:28.750
is living wonderfully.

00:19:29.583 --> 00:19:31.250
Please watch over her.

00:19:31.916 --> 00:19:36.458
Take care, Fran!

00:19:41.375 --> 00:19:44.208
Good work on the undercover job.

00:19:44.208 --> 00:19:47.708
There were several close calls
where I almost died, Uncle.

00:19:47.708 --> 00:19:49.083
Now, now,

00:19:49.083 --> 00:19:52.583
if you must blame someone, blame August Allsand.

00:19:53.083 --> 00:19:56.833
The adventurer we arrested confessed
to working for him

00:19:56.833 --> 00:20:02.125
and using evolution potions on the spiders.

00:20:02.125 --> 00:20:04.708
That's rare.

00:20:04.708 --> 00:20:08.416
The Reidos in the north must've instigated this.

00:20:08.416 --> 00:20:10.500
It is likely.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:14.625
Viscount Allsand colluded with the Reidos

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:18.291
to snatch the rights to the dungeon from us, huh?

00:20:18.291 --> 00:20:21.875
A shameless man indeed.

00:20:21.875 --> 00:20:25.000
Regarding the other task,

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.791
what does your guardian spirit

00:20:27.791 --> 00:20:29.291
think of Miss Fran?

00:20:30.291 --> 00:20:34.166
Guardian Spirit, Tarua!

00:20:37.208 --> 00:20:38.458
From what I can tell,

00:20:38.458 --> 00:20:42.958
Fran does not harbor any evil in her heart.

00:20:42.958 --> 00:20:46.125
She appears curious about everything

00:20:46.125 --> 00:20:49.000
and often talks to herself,

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.250
but I do not sense any malicious intentions.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:55.833
So she is unlikely to be a spy sent from Reidos.

00:20:55.833 --> 00:21:00.333
She is abnormally strong
and growing at an unusually fast speed.

00:21:00.333 --> 00:21:03.833
She will make a formidable enemy
if she turns against us.

00:21:03.833 --> 00:21:07.666
But I've had enough of being suspicious
and making speculations.

00:21:07.666 --> 00:21:11.000
She's just an extraordinary Black Cat.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:13.041
Let's leave it at that.

00:21:14.708 --> 00:21:18.333
I wonder what awaits us on this adventure?

00:21:18.333 --> 00:21:21.875
As long as I have Urushi and Teacher with me,
we can handle anything!

00:21:23.333 --> 00:21:24.375
You're right.

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:04.958
We're flying!

00:23:04.958 --> 00:23:07.583
This is the Telekinesis Air Ride!

00:23:07.583 --> 00:23:10.208
To the Floating Island!

00:23:26.166 --> 00:23:28.875
I am Jean du Vix,

00:23:28.875 --> 00:23:30.875
a supreme necromancer

00:23:30.875 --> 00:23:33.916
in pursuit of the highest order of dark sorcery!

00:23:35.208 --> 00:23:37.250
Who is this guy?
